;; kaiyaku 解約 — SYNTHETIC representative 縁-ledger seed (ADR-2606112201).
;; G1: every member-side fact here is :synthetic — a FICTIONAL demo member, no real PII.
;; Services are :representative — a bounded, honest subset of common service shapes
;; (video sub / gym / SaaS / news / dormant SNS / legacy email-as-SSO / unknown card
;; merchant / duplicate cloud storage). Coverage of the real service universe is ~0 by
;; design; live per-member ingest is G7-gated (organizer/mailer Follow + member consent).
;;
;; Nodes: :svc/* (service) + :member/* (synthetic demo member).
;; 縁:    :en/* edges member→service (:subscribes / :holds-account / :recurring-charge)
;;        and service→service (:depends-on — SSO / payment-method dependency, the
;;        cascade-guard input).

